    {
      "id": "elem_2",
      "content": "摘要"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_3",
      "content": "随着人工智能技术的发展，强化学习（Reinforcement Learning，RL）在机器人控制、自动驾驶、资源调度以及大语言模型（Large Language Models, LLMs）等领域得到了广泛应用。传统的任务调度方法通常依赖于人工设计规则，在面对动态变化的复杂环境时难以获得最优性能。本文提出一种基于深度强化学习（Deep Reinforcement Learning, DRL）的智能任务调度框架，将调度问题建模为马尔可夫决策过程（Markov Decision Process, MDP），利用深度神经网络逼近状态价值函数，实现动态决策优化。实验结果表明，相较于传统启发式算法，本文方法在任务完成时间、资源利用率以及系统吞吐量方面均取得了明显提升。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_4",
      "content": "关键词： 强化学习；深度强化学习；任务调度；智能决策；资源优化"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_5",
      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_6",
      "content": "1 引言"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_7",
      "content": "近年来，随着云计算、边缘计算以及人工智能应用的快速发展，大规模任务调度问题逐渐成为研究热点。传统调度算法如最短作业优先（SJF）、轮询调度（Round Robin）以及遗传算法（GA）等虽然具有一定效果，但普遍存在适应能力不足的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_8",
      "content": "强化学习能够通过智能体（Agent）与环境（Environment）的不断交互学习最优策略，而无需依赖大量人工规则，因此特别适合求解动态优化问题。近年来，Deep Q Network（DQN）、Proximal Policy Optimization（PPO）以及Soft Actor-Critic（SAC）等算法不断推动强化学习的发展，使其能够解决高维状态空间中的复杂决策任务。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_9",
      "content": "本文针对动态任务调度问题，设计了一种基于PPO算法的强化学习调度模型，实现任务执行效率与资源利用率的协同优化。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_10",
      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_11",
      "content": "2 相关工作"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_12",
      "content": "2.1 强化学习基础"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_13",
      "content": "强化学习由智能体、环境、状态、动作以及奖励组成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_14",
      "content": "在时刻 $t$："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_15",
      "content": "状态：$s_t$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_16",
      "content": "动作：$a_t$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_17",
      "content": "奖励：$r_t$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_18",
      "content": "智能体根据策略"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_19",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_20",
      "content": "\\pi(a|s)"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_21",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_22",
      "content": "选择动作，并不断最大化累计奖励"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_23",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_24",
      "content": "Rt=\\sum{k=0}^{\\infty}\\gamma^k r_{t+k}"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_25",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_26",
      "content": "其中："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_27",
      "content": "$\\gamma$ 为折扣因子；"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_28",
      "content": "$0<\\gamma<1$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_29",
      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_30",
      "content": "2.2 深度强化学习"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_31",
      "content": "传统Q-Learning使用Q表记录状态价值："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_32",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_33",
      "content": "Q(s,a)"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_34",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_35",
      "content": "当状态空间较大时无法存储，因此DQN采用神经网络逼近："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_36",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_37",
      "content": "Q(s,a;\\theta)"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_38",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_39",
      "content": "损失函数定义为："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_40",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_41",
      "content": "L(\\theta)="
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_42",
      "content": "(r+\\gamma \\max_{a'}Q(s',a';\\theta^-)-Q(s,a;\\theta))^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_43",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_44",
      "content": "其中："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_45",
      "content": "$\\theta$ 为在线网络参数；"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_46",
      "content": "$\\theta^-$ 为目标网络参数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_47",
      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_48",
      "content": "2.3 PPO算法"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_49",
      "content": "PPO属于策略梯度方法，通过限制策略更新幅度保证训练稳定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_50",
      "content": "其目标函数："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_51",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_52",
      "content": "L^{clip}(\\theta)="
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_53",
      "content": "E["
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_54",
      "content": "\\min("
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_55",
      "content": "rt(\\theta)At,"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_56",
      "content": "clip(rt(\\theta),1-\\epsilon,1+\\epsilon)At"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_57",
      "content": ")]"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_58",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_59",
      "content": "其中"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_60",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_61",
      "content": "r_t(\\theta)="
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_62",
      "content": "\\frac{\\pi_\\theta(a|s)}"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_63",
      "content": "{\\pi{\\theta{old}}(a|s)}"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_64",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_65",
      "content": "相比TRPO，PPO实现更加简单，训练速度更快，因此被广泛应用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_66",
      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_67",
      "content": "3 方法设计"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_68",
      "content": "3.1 问题建模"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_69",
      "content": "系统包含："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_70",
      "content": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_71",
      "content": "Scheduler"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_72",
      "content": "Resource Pool"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_73",
      "content": "Task Queue"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_74",
      "content": "状态包括："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_75",
      "content": "| 状态变量 | 含义 |"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_76",
      "content": "|-----------|------|"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_77",
      "content": "| CPU利用率 | 当前CPU占用 |"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_78",
      "content": "| GPU利用率 | GPU占用率 |"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_79",
      "content": "| 内存利用率 | Memory |"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_80",
      "content": "| 等待队列长度 | Queue Length |"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_81",
      "content": "| 当前任务优先级 | Priority |"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_82",
      "content": "动作空间："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_83",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_84",
      "content": "A=\\{"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_85",
      "content": "Dispatch,"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_86",
      "content": "Delay,"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_87",
      "content": "Reject,"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_88",
      "content": "Migrate"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_89",
      "content": "\\}"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_90",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_91",
      "content": "奖励函数定义："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_92",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_93",
      "content": "Reward="
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_94",
      "content": "-\\alpha T"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_95",
      "content": "+\\beta U"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_96",
      "content": "-\\lambda C"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_97",
      "content": "$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_98",
      "content": "其中："
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_99",
      "content": "T：任务完成时间"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_100",
      "content": "U：资源利用率"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_101",
      "content": "C：资源冲突次数"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_102",
      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_103",
      "content": "3.2 网络结构"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_104",
      "content": "Actor网络："
    }
  ]
